47
00:01:07,583 --> 00:01:08,963
When investors get nervous,

48
00:01:09,143 --> 00:01:10,403
they pay more for that insurance,

49
00:01:10,203 --> 00:01:11,663
and the VIX goes up.

50
00:01:12,243 --> 00:01:14,943
Cboe introduced the VIX in 1993,

51
00:01:14,743 --> 00:01:16,843
and it has calculated values back

52
00:01:16,643 --> 00:01:17,603
