Divide the VIX by about three

58
00:01:23,126 --> 00:01:23,706
and a half.

59
00:01:23,886 --> 00:01:25,406
A VIX of 37 means the

60
00:01:25,206 --> 00:01:27,266
market expects the S&P 500 to

61
00:01:27,066 --> 00:01:28,586
